This repository is a monorepo holding packages under two different licenses.
There is no single repository-wide license; each package's LICENSE file is the
authoritative one for the code under it:

  packages/fastled-math   MIT           see packages/fastled-math/LICENSE
  packages/wled-fx-sim    EUPL-1.2      see packages/wled-fx-sim/LICENSE

@wiillownet/fastled-math is the FastLED-derived math/color/palette kit
(FastLED 3.6.0, MIT). @wiillownet/wled-fx-sim contains TypeScript ports of
WLED's effect implementations (WLED v16.0.0, EUPL-1.2) and depends on the
math package.

Each package also carries a THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md documenting upstream
provenance in detail (FastLED, WLED, and the cpt-city gradient palettes).

Repository-level files outside packages/ (build configuration, CI, this file)
are MIT, per packages/fastled-math/LICENSE's terms.

Unofficial. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the WLED/FastLED projects.
